MODULE: NoAwaitedDriveAwaitDriveOnExclusiveTurn
TARGET: NoAwaitedDrive
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the coverage timer retains its exclusive turn while awaiting the drive
PERTURBS: Dispatch

--- FIND
Dispatch(g) ==
    /\ timer[g] = "dispatch" /\ turn[g] = "timer"
    /\ operation' = [operation EXCEPT ![g] = "running"]
    /\ turn' = ReleaseTurn(g)
    /\ timer' = [timer EXCEPT ![g] = "done"]
    /\ age' = [age EXCEPT ![g] = IF queued[g] THEN @ + 1 ELSE @]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<queued, served>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the coverage timer retains its exclusive turn while awaiting the drive
Dispatch(g) ==
    /\ timer[g] = "dispatch" /\ turn[g] = "timer"
    /\ operation' = [operation EXCEPT ![g] = "running"]
    /\ turn' = HoldTurn(g, "timer")
    /\ timer' = [timer EXCEPT ![g] = "done"]
    /\ age' = [age EXCEPT ![g] = IF queued[g] THEN @ + 1 ELSE @]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<queued, served>>
--- END
